        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "So I was on my way to Little Tokyo for a meeting and hadn't had dinner yet. I REALLY wanted a hot dog. I arrive to my meeting point and find the Vancouver-based <b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japadog\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Japadog\">Japadog</a></b> across the street from my building! It was fate. Turned out they had only been in town so far for a couple of weeks. The yakisoba dog was legit &amp; a total lifesaver!",
